              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo namona iciswango cilefuma muli bemba. Cikwete insengo ikumi limo ne mitwe cine lubali. Cila lusengo luli ne cisote cabufumu. Pali cila mutwe waciko palembelwe ishina lyakusaalula Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.4+DAN.7.5+DAN.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:4-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ici ciswango namwene, mukumoneka cali kwati ni mbwili, lelo amakasa yaciko yali kwati cibea, elyo akanwa kaciko kwati kanwa ka nkalamo. Icisoka epakupeela iciswango amaka yaciko, icipuna cabufumu caiko, na maka yaciko yonse ayakuteeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutwe umo uwa ciswango walemoneka kwati untu wacenenwe imfwila, lelo icilonda ici icishaikulila cena calipola. Abantu icalo conse calibapeseshe amano, balakonka ne ciswango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bonse balapepa icisoka, ico capeele iciswango amaka yaciko ayakuteeka. Balapepa ne ciswango, baleti, “Uwaba nge ciswango ni nani? Bushe nani engacilwisha?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
